### Fazendo uma requisição no /
GET http://127.0.0.1:3000/


### Caso Lower case
POST http://127.0.0.1:3000/util/texto/lowercase HTTP/1.1
Content-Type: application/json

{ "input": "Primeiro Teste"}


### Caso Upper case
POST http://127.0.0.1:3000/util/texto/uppercase HTTP/1.1
Content-Type: application/json

{ "input": "Segundo Teste"}


### minimo
GET http://127.0.0.1:3000/util/numero/minimo/?input=2,10,50,1,20,100 HTTP/1.1


### maximo
GET http://127.0.0.1:3000/util/numero/maximo/?input=2,10,50,1,20,100 HTTP/1.1